    The following table summarizes pattern-matching default values:
 
 Members                Default settings
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Inclusion              ‘--no-wildcards --anchored
                        --no-wildcards-match-slash’
 Exclusion              ‘--wildcards --no-anchored
                        --wildcards-match-slash’
